#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Recording-And-Playing-Back-Data/Recording-And-Playing-Back-Data.rst:247
msgid ""
"``-b <max_bag_size>`` ensures that each file does not exceed "
"``<max_bag_size>`` bytes in file size."
msgstr ""

