"recording workload. For example, record ``/turtle1/cmd_vel`` and ``/turtle1/"
"pose`` in separate terminals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Recording-And-Playing-Back-Data/Recording-And-Playing-Back-Data.rst:377
msgid ""
"Restart the teleoperation node in its terminal, because you stopped it "
"before playback in the previous step:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Recording-And-Playing-Back-Data/Recording-And-Playing-Back-Data.rst:383
#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Recording-And-Playing-Back-Data/Recording-And-Playing-Back-Data.rst:503
msgid "In a new terminal, from the ``bag_files`` directory, run:"
